52, \"text\": \"Boys Like Girls stream \\\"Be Your Everything\\\" preview.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 53, \"end\": 71, \"text\": \"Alternative Press.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 72, \"end\": 85, \"text\": \"July 9, 2012.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 111, \"text\": \"Retrieved March 13, 2025.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 112, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"^ Johan Wippsson (July 15, 2012).\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 208, \"text\": \"\\\"Boys Like Girls Releases Lyric Video For Be Your Everything\\\".\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 209, \"end\": 217, \"text\": \"Melodic.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 218, \"end\": 243, \"text\": \"Retrieved March 13, 2025.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 244, \"end\": 276, \"text\": \"^ Johan Wippsson (July 9, 2012).\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 277, \"end\": 333, \"text\": \"\\\"One Direction Set To Release 'Crazy World' EP July 17\\\".\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 334, \"end\": 342, \"text\": \"Melodic.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 343, \"end\": 368, \"text\": \"Retrieved March 13, 2025.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"start\": 369, \"end\": 404, \"text\": \"^ Johan Wippsson (August 14, 2012).\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 66, \"text\": \"After feeling it was \\\"disingenuous\\\" to the band, they scrapped it.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d02\", \"start\": 67, \"end\": 199, \"text\": \"According to Martin Johnson, the album originally leaned into an electro-pop hybrid sound and \\\"didn't really feel like The Beatles.\\\"\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d02\", \"start\": 200, \"end\": 322, \"text\": \"[2] Johnson retreated to Nashville, writing with other musicians and creating demos that \\\"didn't have a specific purpose.\\\"\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d02\", \"start\": 323, \"end\": 469, \"text\": \"[2] During that time span, he wrote 300 songs and believed a The Beatles album was hiding in there somewhere and sent the members about 24 tracks.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d02\", \"start\": 470, \"end\": 473, \"text\": \"[2]\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Boys Like Girls\", \"scope\": \"Album Artist\", \"claim\": \"Crazy World is the third studio album by American pop rock band Boys Like Girls.\", \"answer\": \"Boys Like Girls\", \"quote\": \"Crazy World (Boys Like Girls album) Crazy World is the third studio album by American pop rock band Boys Like Girls.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0074-0c38ef8fa55a:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"One Direction\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the album/EP \\\"Crazy World\\\"\", \"claim\": \"One Direction is set to release the 'Crazy World' EP.\", \"answer\": \"One Direction\", \"quote\": \"\\\"One Direction Set To Release 'Crazy World' EP July 17\\\".\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Boys Like Girls\", \"One Direction\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"One Direction\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Boys Like Girls\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
